{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/幻梦泡影","pageid":5380,"revid":12606,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%B9%BB%E6%A2%A6%E6%B3%A1%E5%BD%B1&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%B9%BB%E6%A2%A6%E6%B3%A1%E5%BD%B1&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%B9%BB%E6%A2%A6%E6%B3%A1%E5%BD%B1&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>幻梦泡影</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.B9.BB.E6.A2.A6.E6.B3.A1.E5.BD.B1\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"幻梦泡影\"><b>幻梦泡影</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 幻梦泡影.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/69/0k6n1tlsh0oak69vkkpp5xx88506m3j.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%B9%BB%E6%A2%A6%E6%B3%A1%E5%BD%B1.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/69/0k6n1tlsh0oak69vkkpp5xx88506m3j.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%B9%BB%E6%A2%A6%E6%B3%A1%E5%BD%B1.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/69/0k6n1tlsh0oak69vkkpp5xx88506m3j.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />幻梦泡影\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0-3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓8-↑8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（穿透伤害）对目标范围<font color=\"red\">3</font>格内所有敌人，造成魔攻值<font color=\"red\">50%</font>的伤害。攻击前施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"梦魇\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"DeepSkyBlue\">梦魇</font></span></span>] 、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"易伤2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">易伤2</font></span></span>]及[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透易伤2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透易伤2</font></span></span>] ，若目标已有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"梦魇\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"DeepSkyBlue\">梦魇</font></span></span>] ，则额外施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"迷梦回廊\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"DeepSkyBlue\">迷梦回廊</font></span></span>] ，所有效果持续<font color=\"red\">2</font>回合；攻击后对[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"受伤\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">受伤</font></span></span>]状态或已有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"迷梦回廊\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"DeepSkyBlue\">迷梦回廊</font></span></span>]的敌人，额外施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"睡眠\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">睡眠</font></span></span>] ，持续<font color=\"red\">1</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-3 3.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/a3/gna3oc2cjl54ui7uiti4hvjxnhrilam.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-3_3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/a3/gna3oc2cjl54ui7uiti4hvjxnhrilam.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%98%BF%E8%8A%99%E6%8B%89\" title=\"角色图鉴库/阿芙拉\"><img alt=\"头像 阿芙拉.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/01/0oy154u5j4kaasfmqbnj3y2b2gfx2ro.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">阿芙拉</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022163953\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.448 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.607 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 10054/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 171139/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12311/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  583.706      1 模板:技能\n100.00%  583.706      1 -total\n 14.21%   82.941      1 模板:中括号介绍化\n 13.42%   78.313      8 模板:中括号介绍\n  1.47%    8.564      1 模板:面包屑\n  0.97%    5.643      1 模板:列表/头像\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:5380-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022163953 and revision id 12606. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortk